# 06. Color & Theme Architecture

## 06.1 Identity

GrowFlow uses **Soft Intelligence**.

## 06.2 Default Theme

**Soft white / warm light.**

## 06.3 Dark Theme

**Soft charcoal counterpart.**

## 06.4 Palette Philosophy

Use:

- muted neutrals
- one subtle primary accent
- restrained semantic colors
- slightly deeper AI variant

Avoid:

- neon
- rainbow role themes
- excessive gradients
- decorative saturation

## 06.5 Semantic Color

Semantic colors must mean something.

Examples:

- success = successful/healthy/completed
- warning = attention required
- danger = destructive/critical
- info = informational

## 06.6 Dark Mode

Dark mode is independently designed through semantic tokens.

It must not be implemented as blind inversion.

## 06.7 AI Theme

AI may use deeper surfaces/borders but remains inside the same design system.

## 06.8 Role Themes

There are no separate BUILD/SUPERVISE/GOVERN color themes.

Role personality comes from information, context, and actions.

