- productivity

## 07.5 Tablet

Prioritize:

- adaptive columns
- preserved context
- selective stacking

## 07.6 Mobile

Prioritize:

- focused workflows
- progressive disclosure
- touch targets
- reduced visual density

## 07.7 Mobile Sidebar

Authenticated sidebar becomes a drawer.

## 07.8 Responsive Rule

Responsive transformation must preserve task intent, not merely shrink dimensions.

## 07.9 Breakpoints

Breakpoints are centralized design tokens.

## 07.10 Overflow

Components must explicitly define behavior for:

- long text
- wide tables
- code
- timelines
