## 12.1 Table Philosophy

Tables are integrated, dense, and quiet.

## 12.2 Table Features

Where relevant:

- sorting
- filtering
- pagination
- selection
- row actions
- column priority
- expansion
- loading
- empty
- error

## 12.3 Mobile Tables

Use one of:

- horizontal scroll
- prioritized columns
- expandable rows
- detail drawer

