Stitch accelerates visual exploration.

It is not the authority for:

- routes
- backend state
- APIs
- authorization
- domain rules
- security

## 17.2 Prompt Structure

Every page prompt should include:

```text
Product Context
+
Page Identity
+
Role
+
Route
+
Purpose
+
Layout
+
Design System
+
Components
+
Data
+
States
+
Responsive Rules
+
Interactions
+
Restrictions
```

## 17.3 Prompt Inheritance

Every page prompt inherits:

- Soft Intelligence
- warm light default
- charcoal dark counterpart
- restrained palette
- Manrope-style typography
- unified component system
- subtle motion
- accessibility
- responsive behavior

## 17.4 Prohibited Stitch Outcomes

Reject designs that introduce:

- separate role themes
- neon AI
- excessive glassmorphism
- excessive cards
- giant pills
- unnecessary gradients
- decorative charts
